「向錄公見接殷勤，流連不能已，而貌有慚色，此必欲殺我。」三更中，兵至見害。時年二十五。"}],"scope":"桂陽王鑠完整本傳，區別鄱陽王鏘。"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003","unit_id":"xieyue-complete","text":"解褐車騎行參軍，遷祕書郎，司徒祭酒，丹陽丞，撫軍功曹。世祖爲中軍，引爲記室。齊臺建，遷太子中舍人。建元初，轉桂陽王友。以母老須養，出爲安成內史。還爲中書郎。衞軍王儉引爲長史，雅相禮遇。除黃門郎，兼掌吏部。尋轉太子中庶子，領驍騎將軍，轉長兼侍中。𤅢以晨昏有廢，固辭不受。世祖勑令速拜，別停朝直。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","source_position":{"first_line":57,"last_line":57,"revision_id":2400356,"editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"世祖","kind":"person","person_id":"kix_r92_2ed","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"原文具名或局部代稱；身份依全傳及具體來源橋接，不按同字跨世代配人。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-shizu"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0054","start":54,"end":57,"surface":"桂陽王","kind":"person","person_id":"63c_vmw_dyi","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"原文具名或局部代稱；身份依全傳及具體來源橋接，不按同字跨世代配人。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-guiyang"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0060","start":60,"end":61,"surface":"母","kind":"person","person_id":"pm0_bw3_z6p","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"p003以母老須養與晨昏有廢承傳主𤅢，p004段末母喪去官同為𤅢之母；中段孝悌母駱別指。特定母角色，原文未明生母，不推配莊。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-mother"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"王儉","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABAAAAEAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"原文具名或局部代稱；身份依全傳及具體來源橋接，不按同字跨世代配人。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-wangjian"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0122","start":122,"end":123,"surface":"𤅢","kind":"person","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_DBABAC","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"原文具名或局部代稱；身份依全傳及具體來源橋接，不按同字跨世代配人。","identity_decision_id":"d-nanqi043-xieyue-yue"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-043-xieyue:p003:m0134","start":134,"end":136,"surface":"世祖","kind":"person","person_id":"kix_r92